{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","潘"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名低调随和的战士，可以支援能量较高的队友，收起武器后会变的更强。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","潘某，前来领教。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","The hour has come."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","节节攀高，哈哈"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Upwards. Always upwards."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","苍竹，凝气"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Bamboo, stands unshaken."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","人外有人……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Defeat... is inevitable..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","承让，承让。"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Victory was yours to give."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","江湖有缘，幸会了，朋友"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_i18n/en","Hmm, fate brings us together."],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","心静，方可制动！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Calm your mind, to still your heart."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","慢下来，感受变化……"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Hmm. Slow down and feel the change."],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","stt"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","旋身，下击！很简单！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","You need to turn around and strike. It's that simple."],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","stt"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","太感谢了，我非常喜欢。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","噢，太客气了，多谢美意。"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","此处颇有趣味"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","接下来继续去挑战吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","异乡的食物也别有风味啊"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","早年潘仍在故土修行时，遇到过一位来自异国的年轻剑客，那位剑客手中的剑有着风与冰的力量。正是与这位异国朋友的相识激起了潘前往远方看看的念头。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","潘手中的武器是一根普通的竹子，对武者来说，修行到极致，摘叶飞花皆可为兵器——总之，大部分时间下，那竹子不是储备粮。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","潘的掌法远胜棍法，为了控制自己出手的强度，他才经常手持竹棍。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","潘擅长在山林中静静冥想，感受自然的气息，虽然对外人来说很难分清他到底是睡着了还是在修行。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","潘身形强健，但行动却比外形看起来更加轻捷迅速。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","连潘自己也不能否认，在很饿的时候，曾经偷偷啃过手中的竹棍。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","无论走到哪里，潘始终记得来自师傅的教诲：从不以武欺人，但也从不畏惧面临挑战。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","遇到不公之事，潘从不吝于出手相助。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","潘小时候最大的愿望就是成为一名行侠仗义的武者，第二大的愿望就是拥有一片永远啃不完的竹林。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","“是一位很有魅力又超可爱的成熟的黑白相间的侠客救了我。”某位差点被抢劫的女性受害者给出的证词一度让骑士团有些头痛，直到他们遇到了潘。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","这根棍子有点旧了。"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415669.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","索恩 & 潘"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","此处颇有趣味"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415693.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","潘"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","异乡的食物也别有风味啊"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415694.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","潘"]]}